  lines:
  - speaker: 1
    text: Finally, someone wise and intelligent. I take into account the fact that
      you brought this relic to us directly and will therefore not punish you for
      having placed your hands on it.
  - speaker: 0
    text: "Why would I have been punished if I didn\u2019t give it back to you ?"
  - speaker: 1
    text: Oh traveler, I will forgive your ignorance. But be careful with your words
      or you will never be able to see the light of day again.
